  <h1>Gotix 18 — Account Deletion Request</h1>
  <p>Developer: <strong>Abhinav Shukla</strong></p>
  <p>You can request deletion of your Gotix 18 player account and the personal game data associated with it. This page is for <strong>Gotix 18</strong>, not for deleting your Google account.</p>

  <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Use the email account associated with your Gotix 18 sign-in, if available.</li>
    <li>Click the button below to compose an email to our support team.</li>
    <li>Include your Gotix 18 player name or player ID, if known. Do not send passwords, OTPs, or identity documents.</li>
    <li>Our support team will respond with any steps needed to verify account ownership and process your request.</li>
  </ol>
  <p><a class="button" href="mailto:gotix.support@gmail.com?subject=Gotix%2018%20-%20Account%20Deletion%20Request&amp;body=Hello%2C%0A%0AI%20request%20deletion%20of%20my%20Gotix%2018%20account%20and%20associated%20personal%20game%20data.%0A%0APlayer%20name%20or%20ID%20(if%20known)%3A%20%0ASign-in%20method%20(Google%20or%20Guest)%3A%20%0A%0AThank%20you.">Request account deletion by email</a></p>
  <p>If the button does not open your email application, write directly to <a href="mailto:gotix.support@gmail.com">gotix.support@gmail.com</a> with the subject <strong>Gotix 18 — Account Deletion Request</strong>.</p>

  <h2>Data covered by the request</h2>
  <p>We aim to delete your Gotix 18 player profile and associated personal game statistics, such as matches played, wins, and losses. Account-linked multiplayer records will be deleted or de-identified where feasible. Some records may need to be retained where legally required or necessary for security and fraud prevention; any applicable retention will be explained in our response.</p>

  <h2>Important information</h2>
  <div class="note">
    <p><strong>This page submits a request; it does not instantly delete an account.</strong> Deletion is completed only after the developer verifies the request and removes the relevant account and data. An in-app deletion option is planned but is not yet available.</p>
    <p>Guest accounts may be difficult to identify after the app has been uninstalled or local identifiers have been lost. Please include any available player ID.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>See our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> for information about data handling.</p>
